# Cloudflare Pages asset-upload exclusions (gitignore-style syntax).
# These files stay committed to git but are NOT deployed as static assets --
# keeps the deployment under Cloudflare Pages' file-count limit.
#
# Pinterest pin-variant images: generated in bulk (12,000+ files) as a
# build-only asset pool for the Pinterest bulk-CSV importer, not served by
# the live site. Not needed live until an actual Pinterest upload pass,
# which points at a GitHub raw URL instead (see build_pinterest_upload.py).
assets/pinterest/*--v*.png
